":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-24T10:36:15Z","updated_at":"2026-05-24T10:36:15Z","body":"Make sure we also solve these issues in this pull request:\r\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/137\r\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/139\r\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/141\r\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/142\r\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/146\r\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/147\r\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/148\r\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/155\r\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/237\r\n\r\nPlease read these issues with comments, get latest changes from default branch, and make sure we comprehensively support all the features. So for each type of question and its variations in all supported languages, we will use self awareness facts the system knows about, and also settings like for example name if it was set or not and so on.\r\n\r\nSo we need to make advance self awareness system, which also configurable, by default we state facts as them are. These self awareness features are similar to docs, so should be accurate and always updated with the codebase.\r\n\r\nAlso I want to see all tests in a way so question + variations are always near the answer, so it will be easy to review. Answering should also have variations by default.\r\n\r\nWe need to download all logs and data related about issues to this repository, make sure we compile that data to `./docs/case-studies/pull-request-{id}` folder, and use it to do deep case study analysis (also make sure to search online for additional facts and data), in which we will reconstruct timeline/sequence of events, list of each and all requirements from the issue, find root causes of the each problem, and propose possible solutions and solution plans for each requirement (we should also check known existing components/libraries, that solve similar problem or can help in solutions).\r\n\r\nIf there is not enough data to find actual root cause, add debug output and verbose mode if not present, that will allow us to find root cause on next iteration.\r\n\r\nIf issue related to any other repository/project, where we can report issues on GitHub, please do so. Each issue must contain reproducible examples, workarounds and suggestions for fix the issue in code.\r\n\r\nPlease plan and execute everything in this single pull request, you have unlimited time and context, as context auto-compacts and you can continue indefinitely, until it is each and every requirement fully addressed, and everything is totally done.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/comments/4528147091/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/comments/4528150048","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/234#issuecomment-4528150048","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/234","id":4528150048,"node_id":"IC_kwDOSbOoU88AAAABDeYWIA","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gi